Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:55.68,Standard,,0,0,0,,‫{\c&H00FF00&}سلام{\c}‬\N‫{\c&HFFFF00&}سلام{\c}‬\N‫{\c&HFFFFFF&}سلام{\c}‬\N‫{\c&H00FF00&}سلام{\c}‬\N‫{\c&HFFFF00&}سلام{\c}‬
